From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:20:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] DR4: the document list and delegation views apply the
 single-object decisions

Found by a stranger sweep over every in-scope GET route of the generated
inventory. GET /documents listed, with their content, every published
document of the caller's department and ignored the classification barrier;
every candidate is now decided by the document read procedure. GET
/delegations/{id} returned any delegation to any subject, and the delegation
list filtered by object replaced the caller's scope instead of narrowing it;
both now apply the listing's scope (admin, requester, approver, the object's
owner, its department's director, its division's manager).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 backend/app/api/delegations.py | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 backend/app/api/documents.py   | 19 ++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 45 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

